# Local-first health monitor

- Persist chat, vitals, symptoms, settings, and API keys only via `localStorage` (`shm:` keys in `src/lib/storage.ts`).
- **No manual vitals forms** — extract metrics from chat (`src/lib/extractVitals.ts`) and show them read-only in Vitals History.
- Do not seed fake vitals, mock charts, or placeholder health readings.
- Empty states stay minimal (e.g. “No health metrics recorded via chat yet”).
- Keep clinical charcoal surfaces (`#0A0A0B`, `#111113`, `#222226`) and emerald accents unless the user asks to change the look.
